    <string name="notes_privacy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="notes_privacy_body">Kitty Notes stores your notes, categories and sticky notes only on this device in a private local database. Notes are not uploaded anywhere by the Notes feature, and cloud sync is not configured. You can export a backup file yourself from the drawer (Back up notes) and restore it later; that file is wherever you choose to save it. Deleting a note moves it to Trash; permanent deletion removes it from the device. The Notes password lock stores only a secure password hash on this device and protects the Notes section only.</string>
    <string name="notes_feedback">Feedback or Suggestion</string>
    <string name="notes_no_email_app">No email app found</string>
    <string name="notes_about_title">About</string>
    <string name="notes_about_body">Kitty Notes is a sweet little notebook for your everyday thoughts.

• Write and organize notes with categories and tags
• Pin important notes and find them fast with search
• See your notes on a calendar by last-edited date
• Start quickly with templates and Quick Note
• Keep little reminders as Sticky Notes
• Archive old notes or restore them from Trash
• Personalize theme colors and dark mode
• Protect your notes with a password lock
• Back up and restore your notes from a file</string>
